	(text "Charge input, common port: the charger joins on VSYS, DSG body diode side, as the BQ76952 expects\n(PACK pin sees it, p45). Also wakes the AFE from ship mode through LD.\nPLAN 3.7 says reverse-polarity FET. With a reversed charger the blocker sees 54.6 + 54.6 = 109 V: above the\n100 V FET and the LM74700 (75 V, SNOSD17G). So a 150 V Schottky: Vishay V10PM15, pads 1, 2 anode, tab K, 0.6 V, 2.4 W at 4 A. See RATIONALE-log.\nCHARGER_PRESENT: CHG_IN only, so VSYS cannot fake it; high above 34 V, 3.2 V at 54.6 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 38.1 194.31 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a7e93f74-e1fc-5b7f-868c-a6b8c0b2af61")
	)
